OL,3,GNEWSABattening down the hatches before
OL,4,AStorm Austen
OL,5,
OL,6,FExtra safety measures have been set up
OL,7,Fby people and businesses as they
OL,8,Fprepare for the UK's first named storm
OL,9,Fof the season.
OL,11,FStorm Austen is forecast to bring gusts
OL,12,Fof up to 80mph (130km/h) and heavy rain
OL,13,Facross parts of Cornwall and Devon from
OL,14,FThursday night, according to the Met
OL,15,FOffice.
OL,17,FThe conditions, which are also set to
OL,18,Faffect parts of Wales, England's south
OL,19,Fcoast, Wiltshire and Somerset, have led
OL,20,Fto two weather warnings being issued
OL,21,Ffor Friday.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
