OL,3,GNEWSABattening down the hatches before
OL,4,AStorm Austen
OL,5,
OL,6,FBosses at The Watering Hole bar on
OL,7,FPerranporth Beach in Cornwall said they
OL,8,Fwere taking extra precautions after the
OL,9,Fvenue suffered damage during Storm
OL,10,FGoretti in January.
